    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rēspersĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				sprinkling over</i>, <i>besprinkling</i>
			(Ciceron.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pigmentorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Div. 2, 21, 48</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ne sumptuosa respersio,</span>”
				<i>a sprinkling of the funeral pile with wine</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Leg. 2, 24, 60</span></i>
			; v. 1. respergo, I.</div>
